data: {"id": "8b664cbce0ca453b-thinking-parallel_evidence-673", "run_id": "8b664cbce0ca453b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n**实体身份**\n- Pod: `workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h`, namespace: `aiops-case-08`\n- UID: `f371c9da-cbaf-447f-8ec3-e90fd82caa5d` (来自 events)\n- Node: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- 容器名: `app`\n- 状态: `CrashLoopBackOff` (kubectl_get), 重启 6 次\n- 标签: `aiops.lab/case-id=c08`, `app.kubernetes.io/name=workload`\n\n**事实**\n1. **状态确认**: Pod 当前处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，已重启 6 次，最后一次重启在 4m52s 前。\n2. **事件证据**: `kubelet` 报告 `Back-off restarting failed container app`，表明容器持续崩溃并被 K8s 限制重启频率。\n3. **崩溃原因**: `kubectl_describe` 显示容器的", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788450399161, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

